@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam arrowColor #4b5563
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #4b5563
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #4b5563
hide footbox
title Market Desk | Ask and shopping tools

actor Shopper
participant "Ask controller" as Web
participant "CityU DeepSeek" as Model
participant "Local tools" as Tools
database "H2" as DB

Shopper -> Web: Submit a question
Web --> Shopper: Show the question and pending reply
Web -> Model: Recent messages and tool definitions
loop As needed within the current reply
  Model -> Web: Request catalogue, shopping or calculation tool
  Web -> Tools: Validate tool arguments and run the requested operation
  opt Tool reads saved records
    Tools -> DB: Query the accepted catalogue or local shopper data
    DB --> Tools: Return checked records
  end
  Tools --> Web: Return checked data or an action preview
  Web --> Model: Send tool result
end
alt Model returns a reply
  Model --> Web: Reply text
  opt Valid action can apply without confirmation
    Web -> Tools: Apply action and build a receipt
    Tools -> DB: Save the local change
  end
  Web --> Shopper: Show the reply with checked cards or action preview
  opt Action requires confirmation
    Shopper -> Web: Confirm the specific preview
    Web -> Tools: Validate the preview against current records
    alt Preview is current
      Tools -> DB: Save the confirmed change
      Web --> Shopper: Show the receipt
    else Records have changed
      Web --> Shopper: Show an updated preview or an error
    end
  end
else Provider unavailable
  Web --> Shopper: Keep the question available for retry
end
@enduml
